{
  "title": "Stellar — offline almanac prototype",
  "layout": {
    "chrome_head": false,
    "top_pad_px": 40
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "class": "chrome-head",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "class": "brand",
          "children": [
            { "tag": "b", "text": "Stellar" },
            { "text": " · sky map" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "nav",
          "class": "site-nav",
          "aria-label": "Sections",
          "children": [
            { "tag": "a", "href": "index.html", "text": "Observatory" },
            { "tag": "a", "href": "catalog.html", "text": "Catalog" },
            { "tag": "a", "href": "map.html", "aria-current": "page", "text": "Sky Map" },
            { "tag": "a", "href": "guide.html", "text": "Guide" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "main",
      "class": "page",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "class": "eyebrow",
          "text": "Deep-field projection · 28 objects"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "text": "One sky, plotted in full"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "class": "lede",
          "text": "Every object in the almanac — galaxies, nebulae, clusters, and stars — placed on a single circular sky map by its position in the heavens. Hover any glow to read its name, constellation, and brightness; toggle labels to trace the pattern yourself."
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Browse the chart"
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "class": "map-wrap",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "canvas",
              "id": "map",
              "aria-label": "An interactive circular map of the night sky with all catalog objects plotted by position"
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "class": "compass",
              "aria-hidden": "true",
              "children": [
                { "tag": "span", "class": "c-n", "text": "N" },
                { "tag": "span", "class": "c-e", "text": "E" },
                { "tag": "span", "class": "c-s", "text": "S" },
                { "tag": "span", "class": "c-w", "text": "W" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "class": "hovercard hidden",
              "role": "status",
              "children": [
                { "tag": "div", "class": "hover-name", "id": "hover-name", "text": "—" },
                { "tag": "div", "class": "hover-sub", "id": "hover-sub", "text": "" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "class": "chips",
          "role": "group",
          "aria-label": "Filter and display options",
          "children": [
            { "tag": "button", "class": "chip", "data-filter": "all", "aria-pressed": "true", "text": "All types" },
            { "tag": "button", "class": "chip", "data-filter": "Galaxy", "aria-pressed": "false", "text": "Galaxies" },
            { "tag": "button", "class": "chip", "data-filter": "Nebula", "aria-pressed": "false", "text": "Nebulae" },
            { "tag": "button", "class": "chip", "data-filter": "Cluster", "aria-pressed": "false", "text": "Clusters" },
            { "tag": "button", "class": "chip", "data-filter": "Star", "aria-pressed": "false", "text": "Stars" },
            { "tag": "button", "class": "chip", "id": "labels", "aria-pressed": "true", "text": "Labels" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "class": "countline",
          "id": "countline",
          "aria-live": "polite"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "Reading the map"
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "class": "prose",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "children": [
                { "text": "The disk is a stereographic projection of the whole sky, north ",
                  "strong": "up"
                },
                { "text": " and the celestial equator running roughly across the middle. Brighter objects sit as larger, more luminous glows; each colour codes a category — " },
                { "em": "galaxies" },
                { "text": " in cool blue, " },
                { "em": "nebulae" },
                { "text": " in magenta, " },
                { "em": "clusters" },
                { "text": " in teal, and " },
                { "em": "stars" },
                { "text": " in warm gold." }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "children": [
                { "text": "Objects are placed by their real sky coordinates, so a given night's sky is a rotating slice of this map. Switch " },
                { "em": "Labels" },
                { "text": " off and sweep the pointer across the disk to find each glow by position — the same warm-up astronomers do before they ever need to look one up in the catalog." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "footer",
      "class": "chrome-foot",
      "children": [
        { "tag": "span", "text": "Compiled for quiet nights · values rounded to catalog precision" },
        { "tag": "span", "text": "Stellar · fully offline" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
